==Armenian==
{{wikipedia|Ապաթարց|lang=hy}}

===Punctuation mark===
{{head|hy|punctuation mark}}

# {{n-g|Armenian apostrophe, {{m|hy|ապաթարց}}}}
## {{n-g|In [[Old Armenian]] placed before the preposition {{m|xcl|ի}} to differentiate it from words starting with the letter ի.}}
##: {{ux|hy|’ի տուն|t=to home|inline=1}}
## {{n-g|In literary [[Western Armenian]], replaces reduced vowels, especially in the case of the particles {{l|hy|կը}}, {{l|hy|մը|id=article}}, {{l|hy|չի}}.}}
##: {{ux|hy|կ’ըսէ|t=says|inline=1}}
##: {{ux|hy|չ’երթար|t=doesn't go|inline=1}}
## {{n-g|In transliterating European proper nouns with apostrophes, such as names with the particles {{m|fr|d'}}, {{m|en|O'}}, transliterates the apostrophe.}}
##: {{ux|hy|Ժաննա դ’Արկ|t=Joan of Arc|inline=1}}

====Usage notes====
* According to the Unicode Standard, U+055A ARMENIAN APOSTROPHE has the same shape and function as the Latin apostrophe at U+2019 RIGHT SINGLE QUOTATION MARK, which is preferred.<ref>[https://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode15.0.0/ch07.pdf#page=35 The Unicode Standard 15.0, page 322]</ref>

